    {
      "source": "aztec/final_permit.pdf",
      "locator": "Page: 10, Section: part_i",
      "exact_span": "The statistical analyses used to determine if there is a significant difference between the control and the critical dilution shall be in accordance with the methods for determining the No Observed Effect Concentration (NOEC) as described in the appropriate method manual listed in Part II or the most recent update thereof.",
